    "excerpt": "Unilever Pakistan has opened 5 verified job requisitions on its official Workday careers portal for October 2026—including JM Operations Home Care (open to fresh engineering graduates) and Procurement Partner HC in Karachi, plus Instore Manager, Territory Manager UFS, and Shifts Manager Foods in Lahore. Deadlines fall on 23 and 24 October 2026.",
    "content": [
      "# Unilever Pakistan Jobs October 2026: 5 Verified Openings in Karachi & Lahore (Apply by 23–24 Oct)",
      "## Executive Summary & Official Portal Verification\n\n**Unilever Pakistan Limited** is accepting online applications for **five (5) verified job requisitions** across its Supply Chain and Customer Development divisions in **Karachi (Sindh)** and **Lahore (Punjab)**. Verified directly on the [Unilever Pakistan Official Careers Portal](https://careers.unilever.com/en/search-jobs/Pakistan/34155/2/1168579/30/70/50/2) and Workday system on **18 October 2026**, these openings include a Karachi manufacturing role (**JM Operations HC – Job ID R-1189581**) that explicitly welcomes **fresh engineering graduates**. Deadlines fall on **23 and 24 October 2026**.",
      "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Verified Unilever Pakistan Snapshot (18 October 2026):**\n> - **Total Active Pakistan Openings:** **5 Confirmed Requisitions** (2 in Karachi, Sindh; 3 in Lahore, Punjab).\n> - **Fresh Graduate Role in Karachi:** **JM Operations HC (`R-1189581`)** at Unilever CM Factory, Karachi explicitly welcomes **fresh engineering graduates** (6+ months manufacturing experience preferred).\n> - **Salary Status:** Market-competitive FMCG package (exact salary not disclosed on the portal).\n> - **Deadlines:** **23 October 2026** (Supply Chain) and **24 October 2026** (Customer Development).",
      "## Verified Unilever Pakistan Vacancies Table (October 2026)\n\n| JOB TITLE & ID | CITY / SITE | FUNCTION | EDUCATION & EXPERIENCE | DEADLINE | OFFICIAL LINK |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **JM Operations HC (`R-1189581`)** | **Karachi** (CM Factory) | Supply Chain | B.E./B.Sc Engineering; **Fresh Engineering Graduates Welcome** (6+ mos mfg preferred) | **23 Oct 2026** | [Apply on Unilever Portal](https://careers.unilever.com/en/job/karachi/jm-operations-hc/34155/101983453504) |\n| **Procurement Partner HC (`R-1189580`)** | **Karachi** | Supply Chain | Bachelor's in Engineering (Preferred); Proven procurement/sourcing experience | **23 Oct 2026** | [Apply on Unilever Portal](https://careers.unilever.com/en/job/karachi/procurement-partner-hc/34155/101983453680) |\n| **Instore Manager (`R-1189466`)** | **Lahore** | Customer Dev | Bachelor's Degree; 1–4 years FMCG sales experience preferred; Power BI & MS Office | **24 Oct 2026** | [Apply on Unilever Portal](https://careers.unilever.com/en/job/lahore/instore-manager/34155/102034173536) |\n| **Territory Manager Pull – UFS (`R-1189688`)** | **Lahore** | Customer Dev (UFS) | University Graduate (Business Major plus); Min 1 year Key Accounts / HORECA experience | **24 Oct 2026** | [Apply on Unilever Portal](https://careers.unilever.com/en/job/lahore/territory-manager-pull-ufs/34155/102034173360) |\n| **Shifts Manager – Foods (`R-1189570`)** | **Lahore** (Foods Factory) | Supply Chain | B.Sc Engineering; 2–4 years FMCG / manufacturing production experience | **23 Oct 2026** | [Apply on Unilever Portal](https://careers.unilever.com/en/job/lahore/shifts-manager-foods/34155/101991756304) |",
      "## Karachi, Sindh Openings (Apply by 23 October 2026)\n\n### 1. JM Operations HC — Home Care (`Job ID: R-1189581`)\n- **Site & Scope:** Unilever CM Factory, **Karachi** (Full-time, Contractual; reports to Works Manager – Home Care).\n- **Eligibility:** **Fresh engineering graduates are welcome to apply** (6+ months manufacturing experience preferred), with strong fundamentals in process equipment and business acumen.\n- **Responsibilities:** Developing factory SOPs, exploring low-cost automation projects, optimizing utility consumption and alternate fuel sources, refining end-to-end Home Care manufacturing strategy, and building real-time KPI monitoring systems.\n\n### 2. Procurement Partner HC — Home Care (`Job ID: R-1189580`)\n- **Site & Scope:** **Karachi, Sindh** (Full-time, Contractual; reports to Local Procurement Partner – CAPEX, MRO).\n- **Eligibility:** Bachelor's degree in Engineering (preferred) with proven procurement, low-value sourcing, or vendor management experience in manufacturing/FMCG.\n- **Responsibilities:** Sourcing and evaluating third-party manufacturers on safety, quality, capacity, and cost; negotiating contracts; managing supplier performance; and mitigating supply chain risks.",
      "## Lahore, Punjab Openings (Apply by 23–24 October 2026)\n\n- **Instore Manager (`R-1189466` – Deadline: 24 Oct 2026):** Requires a Bachelor's degree, 1–4 years FMCG sales experience (preferred), financial acumen, and Power BI skills to manage retail store execution, customer profitability, and merchandisers in Lahore.\n- **Territory Manager Pull – UFS (`R-1189688` – Deadline: 24 Oct 2026):** Requires a university graduate (Business major plus) with at least 1 year of Key Accounts / HORECA (hotels, restaurants, caterers) experience for Unilever Food Solutions in Lahore.\n- **Shifts Manager – Foods (`R-1189570` – Deadline: 23 Oct 2026):** Requires B.Sc Engineering with 2–4 years of FMCG/manufacturing production experience to lead shift production, TPM autonomous maintenance, HSE, and HACCP compliance at Lahore Foods Factory.",
      "## Fraud-Prevention & Application Instructions\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> **Official Unilever Anti-Fraud Notice:**\n> Unilever states: *\"We will never ask for the exchange of money or credit card details in the Recruitment process.\"* Apply strictly through **`careers.unilever.com`** or **`unilever.wd3.myworkdayjobs.com`**.",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\n\n**Q1: Which Unilever Pakistan job is open to fresh graduates in Karachi?**\n**JM Operations HC (`R-1189581`)** at Unilever CM Factory, Karachi welcomes fresh engineering graduates until **23 October 2026**.\n\n**Q2: How can I see only Pakistan jobs on Unilever's portal?**\nUse the official Pakistan filter page: [Unilever Pakistan Active Jobs](https://careers.unilever.com/en/search-jobs/Pakistan/34155/2/1168579/30/70/50/2).\n\n**Q3: What are the application deadlines?**\nSupply Chain roles close on **23 October 2026**, and Customer Development roles close on **24 October 2026**.",
      "## Official Links & Related CareerDost Guides\n\n- **Official Portal:** [Unilever Pakistan Search Portal](https://careers.unilever.com/en/search-jobs/Pakistan/34155/2/1168579/30/70/50/2)\n- **Related CareerDost Guides:**\n  - [Unilever Pakistan Future Leaders Programme 2026](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/unilever-future-leaders-2026)\n  - [Samba Bank Jobs 2026: Relationship Associate in Karachi & Lahore](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/samba-bank-relationship-associate-jobs-2026)\n  - [Bank Alfalah Jobs 2026: Counter Service Officer Guide](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/bank-alfalah-jobs-internships-2026)\n  - [Aga Khan University (AKU) Karachi Jobs & Traineeships 2026](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/aku-karachi-jobs-traineeships-2026)"
    ],
