    "excerpt": "Samba Bank Limited invites applications from fresh graduates and early-career business professionals for permanent Relationship Associate – SME Banking positions in Karachi and Lahore. Review verified responsibilities, eligibility criteria, and official email application instructions before 31 October 2026.",
    "content": [
      "# Samba Bank Jobs 2026: Relationship Associate (SME Banking) in Karachi & Lahore – Apply by 31 October",
      "## Executive Summary & Official Vacancy Verification\n\n**Samba Bank Limited** has announced full-time, permanent vacancies for **Relationship Associate – SME Banking** across its commercial hubs in **Karachi and Lahore**. Verified directly from the official [Samba Bank Careers Portal](https://www.samba.com.pk/career/) on 18 October 2026, this entry-level role welcomes **fresh graduates** as well as candidates with up to one year of banking experience. Applications close on **31 October 2026**.",
      "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Verified Vacancy Snapshot (18 October 2026):**\n> - **Employer:** Samba Bank Limited (Head Office: Sidco Avenue Centre, Karachi).\n> - **Designation:** Relationship Associate – SME Banking.\n> - **Employment Status:** Full-Time, Permanent Staff Cadre.\n> - **Locations:** **Karachi (Sindh)** and **Lahore (Punjab)**.\n> - **Education:** Graduation from an HEC-recognized university (**Business Studies preferred**).\n> - **Experience:** **Fresh Graduates may apply** (minimum 1 year experience preferred).\n> - **Salary / Benefits:** Market-competitive permanent package with health and life insurance (exact PKR figure not disclosed in the official notice).\n> - **Official Deadline:** **31 October 2026**.",
      "## Quick Facts & Active Samba Bank October 2026 Openings\n\nAlongside the Relationship Associate track for fresh graduates, Samba Bank's careers page lists several active permanent roles closing on **31 October 2026**:\n\n| POSITION TITLE | LOCATIONS | EDUCATION | EXPERIENCE | DEADLINE | STATUS |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Relationship Associate – SME Banking** | **Karachi, Lahore** | Graduation (Business Preferred) | **Fresh Grad** / 1 Yr Pref | **31 Oct 2026** | **Verified Open** |\n| **Universal Teller** | All Cities | Bachelor's (Business/Commerce) | 1+ Years Experience | 31 Oct 2026 | Verified Open |\n| **Verification Officer** | Karachi | Graduation | 1+ Years Experience | 31 Oct 2026 | Verified Open |\n| **RM / Senior RM – SME Banking** | Karachi, LHE, FSD, Sialkot | Graduation (Business Preferred) | 3+ Yrs (RM) / 5 Yrs (SRM) | 31 Oct 2026 | Verified Open |\n| **Branch Services Manager** | Multiple Cities | Graduation | 5+ Years Operations | 31 Oct 2026 | Verified Open |",
      "## Eligibility Criteria & Candidate Profile\n\nTo qualify for the **Relationship Associate – SME Banking** position in Karachi or Lahore, applicants must satisfy these official requirements:\n\n1. **Academic Qualification:** Minimum Bachelor's / Graduation degree from an HEC-recognized university, preferably in **Business Studies (BBA, BS Accounting & Finance, B.Com, MBA, or Economics)**.\n2. **Experience Level:** Open to **fresh university graduates**; candidates with 1 year of experience in SME, credit, or commercial banking are preferred.\n3. **Financial & Credit Skills:** Basic lending knowledge, credit analysis skills, and quantitative ability to evaluate client financial statements and build projections.\n4. **Business Understanding:** Working familiarity with commercial banking, SME financing, trade finance, and general banking operations.\n5. **Core Competencies:** Strong communication, problem-solving, teamwork, and strict adherence to deadlines.\n6. **Equal Opportunity:** Samba Bank actively encourages **female candidates and persons with disabilities (PWDs)** to apply.",
      "## Core Job Responsibilities in SME Banking\n\nSelected Relationship Associates work alongside the **Unit Head and Senior Relationship Managers (SRMs)** within the SME Banking division:\n\n- **Portfolio & New-to-Bank (NTB) Marketing:** Marketing SME banking products to new clients and managing existing SME portfolios efficiently.\n- **Credit Proposal Preparation:** Drafting credit proposals, analyzing client financial statements, assessing industry risks, and maintaining complete client documentation (*housekeeping*).\n- **Target Market Screening:** Assisting the Unit Head and SRM in identifying top-tier SME clients, evaluating competitive strengths, and establishing risk mitigations.\n- **Cross-Selling Banking Solutions:** Collaborating with **Treasury, Cash Management, Trade, and Investment Banking** teams to create and implement cross-sell opportunities.\n- **Credit Exposure & Compliance:** Monitoring assigned account exposures in compliance with Samba Bank credit policies and State Bank of Pakistan (SBP) prudential regulations.\n- **MIS & Revenue Support:** Assisting the Unit Head with Management Information System (MIS) tracking for SME business targets.",
      "## Verified Application Instructions\n\nSamba Bank accepts applications via its official Human Resources email channel:\n\n1. **Update Your CV:** Highlight your business degree, financial analysis coursework, Excel skills, and any internships.\n2. **Send Email to Official HR:** Email your resume to **`careers@samba.com.pk`**.\n3. **Mandatory Subject Line:** Clearly state **`Relationship Associate – SME Banking`** in the email subject line.\n4. **Official Portal Option:** You may also visit [samba.com.pk/career](https://www.samba.com.pk/career/) and click **Apply Now** under the listing before **31 October 2026**.",
      "## Fraud-Prevention Advisory\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> **Mandatory Safety Notice:**\n> Samba Bank Limited never charges any application, test, or processing fee. Only apply via **`careers@samba.com.pk`** and ignore third-party agents requesting payment.",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\n\n**Q1: Can fresh graduates apply for Samba Bank Relationship Associate?**\nYes. The official notice states: *\"Fresh Graduate / experienced with minimum 1 year will be preferred.\"*\n\n**Q2: Where are the positions located?**\nIn **Karachi** and **Lahore** on a full-time permanent basis.\n\n**Q3: What is the application deadline?**\nThe official closing date is **31 October 2026**.\n\n**Q4: How do I submit my application?**\nEmail your CV to **`careers@samba.com.pk`** with **`Relationship Associate – SME Banking`** in the subject line.",
      "## Official Links & Related CareerDost Guides\n\n- **Official Source:** [Samba Bank Limited – Current Openings](https://www.samba.com.pk/career/)\n- **Related CareerDost Guides:**\n  - [Bank Alfalah Jobs & Internships 2026: Counter Service Officer Guide](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/bank-alfalah-jobs-internships-2026)\n  - [HBL Jobs 2026: The League Management Trainee Guide](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/hbl-jobs-internships-the-league-2026)\n  - [MCB Bank Jobs 2026: Information Security Trainee in Karachi](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/mcb-bank-infosec-trainee-jobs-2026)\n  - [Unilever Pakistan Jobs October 2026: Karachi & Lahore Openings](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/unilever-pakistan-jobs-october-2026)"
    ],
