    "excerpt": "Updated 18 October 2026: Bank Alfalah is actively recruiting Counter Service Officers (CSO) nationwide for fresh graduates and candidates with up to 2 years of experience, alongside Relationship Manager, Call Center, Agri Finance, and PWD Paid Internship tracks. Check official responsibilities and direct application links.",
    "content": [
      "# Bank Alfalah Jobs 2026: Counter Service Officer, Fresh Graduate Vacancies & Internships Guide",
      "## Executive Summary & 18 October 2026 Editorial Update\n\n**Bank Alfalah Limited (BAFL)**, operating over 1,000 commercial and Islamic branches across Pakistan, is actively accepting online applications for **Counter Service Officer (CSO)** and retail banking roles. Verified on **18 October 2026** via the official [Bank Alfalah Career Opportunities Portal](https://www.bankalfalah.com/careers/career-opportunities/experienced-professionals/), the **Counter Service Officer** position welcomes **fresh graduates as well as candidates with up to two (2) years of experience** for placement across **Pan-Pakistan** branches, including **Karachi, Hyderabad, Sukkur, Larkana, Mirpurkhas, and major national cities**.",
      "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Unified Bank Alfalah Guide Notice (Updated 18 October 2026):**\n> CareerDost maintains this **single combined Bank Alfalah recruitment guide** covering the newly verified **Counter Service Officer (CSO)** listing alongside active Relationship Manager, Call Center, Agri Finance, and PWD Paid Internship tracks.",
      "## Verified Bank Alfalah Career Opportunities at a Glance\n\n| POSITION / PROGRAM | EDUCATION | EXPERIENCE | LOCATIONS | DEADLINE / STATUS | OFFICIAL APPLY LINK |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Counter Service Officer (CSO)** | **Graduate** | **Fresh to 2 Years** | **Pan-Pakistan** | **Open (Not Stated)** | [Direct CSO Form](https://www.bankalfalah.com/employee-application/?job_title=7&job_category=experiencedIndividual) |\n| **Relationship Manager (Retail)** | Graduate | Min 1 Year Liability Sales | Pan-Pakistan | Open Rolling Intake | [Direct RM Form](https://www.bankalfalah.com/employee-application/?job_title=8&job_category=experiencedIndividual) |\n| **Relationship Manager (Islamic)** | 14 Years (HEC) | Min 1 Year Liability Sales | Pan-Pakistan | Open Rolling Intake | [Direct Islamic RM Form](https://www.bankalfalah.com/employee-application/?job_title=2&job_category=experiencedIndividual) |\n| **Call Center Officer (CCO)** | Graduation | Fresh to 1 Year | Karachi & Lahore | Open Rolling Intake | [Careers Portal](https://www.bankalfalah.com/careers/) |\n| **Relationship Executive & Agri** | Graduation / Agri | Fresh to 1 Year | Nationwide / Agri Belts | Open Rolling Intake | [Careers Portal](https://www.bankalfalah.com/careers/) |\n| **Paid Internship for PWDs** | Final-Yr / Grad | No Experience | Nationwide | Open Periodic Intake | [Careers Portal](https://www.bankalfalah.com/careers/) |",
      "## Featured Spotlight: Counter Service Officer (CSO)\n\n### Official Job Summary & Core Branch Responsibilities\nAccording to Bank Alfalah's official job specification on the [Experienced & Entry Professionals Portal](https://www.bankalfalah.com/careers/career-opportunities/experienced-professionals/), the **Counter Service Officer (CSO)** facilitates branch customers accurately and within turnaround time (TAT) benchmarks across these core areas:\n\n1. **Cash & Counter Operations:** Processing daily cash deposits, cheque payments, and currency verification under Bank Alfalah (BAFL) internal controls and State Bank of Pakistan (SBP) regulations.\n2. **National Prize Bonds & Utility Bills:** Managing National Prize Bond transactions, utility bill collections, and tax receipts.\n3. **Funds Transfers & Clearing:** Executing inter-branch/inter-bank funds transfers and handling inward and outward clearing and collection.\n4. **Payment Instruments & Stop Payments:** Issuing Pay Orders (PO), Demand Drafts (DD), and processing Stop Payment instructions with full audit compliance.\n\n### CSO Eligibility Criteria\n- **Minimum Education:** **Graduate** (minimum 14 to 16 years of education, such as B.Com, BBA, BS, BA, or B.Sc from an HEC-recognized university).\n- **Experience Requirement:** **Fresh graduates or up to 2 years of experience** in cash operations or retail banking.\n- **Locations:** **Pan-Pakistan** (nationwide branch network across Sindh, Punjab, KP, Balochistan, Islamabad, and AJK).\n- **Compensation:** Exact salary is not stated on the public notice; selected officers receive market-competitive banking pay and SBP-regulated benefits.",
      "## Additional Active Bank Alfalah Tracks\n\n- **Relationship Manager (Conventional & Islamic):** Open nationwide for graduates (14+ years education) with at least **1 year of liability sales experience** to drive deposit growth and cross-sell banking products.\n- **Call Center Officer (Karachi & Lahore):** Open to fresh graduates with strong Urdu and English communication skills for 24/7 digital banking and card support.\n- **Associate Relationship Manager – Agri Finance:** Open to B.Sc / M.Sc Agriculture graduates in agricultural districts of Sindh (Hyderabad, Mirpurkhas, Sanghar, Sukkur) and Punjab.\n- **Paid Internship for Persons with Disabilities (PWDs):** A 4–6 week paid corporate internship for differently-abled students and fresh graduates holding NADRA Special CNICs.",
      "## Verified Application Instructions\n\n1. **Visit the Official Page:** Open [Bank Alfalah Experienced Professionals](https://www.bankalfalah.com/careers/career-opportunities/experienced-professionals/) and locate **Counter Service Officer**.\n2. **Open Direct Application Form:** Click **Apply Now** to access [`bankalfalah.com/employee-application/?job_title=7&job_category=experiencedIndividual`](https://www.bankalfalah.com/employee-application/?job_title=7&job_category=experiencedIndividual).\n3. **Submit Details & CV:** Enter your CNIC, contact details, city preference, education, and experience (*Fresh* or *1–2 Years*), attach your PDF resume, and submit.",
      "## Fraud-Prevention Advisory\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> **Zero Fee Policy:** Bank Alfalah never charges any fee for job applications, tests, or interviews. Only apply on official **`bankalfalah.com`** links.",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)\n\n**Q1: Can fresh graduates apply for Bank Alfalah Counter Service Officer?**\nYes. The official requirement is *\"Minimum Education: Graduate\"* and *\"Minimum Experience: Fresh or up to 2 years experience.\"*\n\n**Q2: What is the application deadline for Counter Service Officer?**\nNo closing deadline is stated; Bank Alfalah reviews applications on an ongoing rolling basis nationwide.\n\n**Q3: How do I apply directly for the CSO post?**\nUse the official form at [Bank Alfalah CSO Application](https://www.bankalfalah.com/employee-application/?job_title=7&job_category=experiencedIndividual).",
      "## Official Links & Related CareerDost Guides\n\n- **Official Source:** [Bank Alfalah Career Opportunities](https://www.bankalfalah.com/careers/career-opportunities/experienced-professionals/)\n- **Related CareerDost Guides:**\n  - [Samba Bank Jobs 2026: Relationship Associate (SME Banking)](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/samba-bank-relationship-associate-jobs-2026)\n  - [HBL Jobs 2026: The League Management Trainee Guide](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/hbl-jobs-internships-the-league-2026)\n  - [MCB Bank Jobs 2026: Information Security Trainee in Karachi](https://careerdost.blog/jobs/mcb-bank-infosec-trainee-jobs-2026)"
    ],
