    "metaDescription": "Sindh Job Portal (sjp.gos.pk) hosts provincial vacancies including Junior Clerk (BPS-11). Check general eligibility, STS screening criteria, and portal status.",
    "focusKeyword": "Sindh Job Portal 2026 Junior Clerk",
