      "### Fee Structure Highlights & Waivers",
      "According to the official fee schedule displayed by the Hyderabad campus:\n- **Application Processing Fee:** Rs. 2,000\n- **Course Registration & Exam Fees:** Charged per semester alongside tuition.\n- **Disability Fee Waiver:** Complete tuition fee waiver and degree equivalence fee waiver are provided for students with certified disabilities in accordance with university policy.",
      "### Step-by-Step Application Procedure",
      "1. Navigate to the official admission portal: `admissionshyd.szabist.edu.pk`.\n2. Create an applicant profile using a functional email address and active mobile number.\n3. Select your intended degree programme and complete your academic background details.\n4. Upload scanned copies of your Matriculation and Intermediate marks sheets, CNIC/B-Form, and passport-size photographs.\n5. Generate the admission processing fee voucher (Rs. 2,000) and pay via authorized bank branches or designated online banking channels.\n6. Upload proof of fee payment and finalize submission before **10 December 2026**.\n7. Print your application confirmation and monitor your portal profile for entry test roll numbers.",
      "### Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",
      "**Q1: What is the deadline to apply for SZABIST Hyderabad Spring 2027?**\nThe last date to submit online applications is **10 December 2026**.\n\n**Q2: When will the entry tests take place?**\nThe on-campus entry tests are scheduled for **14 and 15 December 2026**.\n\n**Q3: What is the minimum percentage required for BS Computer Science?**\nCandidates must have at least 50% marks in Intermediate (HSSC) or equivalent qualification with Mathematics.\n\n**Q4: Can awaiting-result students apply?**\nCandidates with completed Part-I results may apply subject to the university's provisional admission guidelines."
