      "- **Issuing Institution:** The Shaikh Ayaz University, Shikarpur, Sindh\n- **Notification Date:** 10 October 2026\n- **Previous Application Deadline:** 10 October 2026\n- **Revised Application Deadline:** **Saturday, 17 October 2026**\n- **Pre-Entry Admission Test:** **Saturday, 7 November 2026**\n- **Test Results Announcement:** **Monday, 9 November 2026**\n- **First Merit List Display:** **Wednesday, 11 November 2026**\n- **Commencement of Classes:** **4 January 2027**\n- **Application Processing Fee:** **Rs. 2,500** (Payable via Habib Bank Limited / designated challan)\n- **Official Extension Notice:** [saus.edu.pk Extension Notice](https://saus.edu.pk/admissions-2027-last-date-to-apply-extended-to-17-october-2026/)\n- **Online Admission Portal:** [admissions.saus.edu.pk/admissions](https://admissions.saus.edu.pk/admissions)",
      "### Academic Programmes Offered",
      "The university is admitting students into both **1st Semester (4-Year BS)** and **5th Semester (Lateral Entry)** programmes across key faculties:\n- **Bachelor of Business Administration (BBA)**\n- **BS Computer Science (BSCS)**\n- **BS Information Technology (BSIT)**\n- **BS Mathematics**\n- **BS Commerce**\n- **BS English Literature & Linguistics**\n- **B.Ed. (Hons.) 4-Year Elementary Education**",
      "### Eligibility Criteria",
      "1. **1st Semester (BS Programmes):** Relevant Intermediate (HSSC) qualification with at least 50% marks from a recognized intermediate board.\n2. **5th Semester (Lateral Entry):** Relevant 2-Year Associate Degree (ADA, ADS, ADC) or equivalent qualification with at least 50% marks.\n3. **Merit Determination Formula:** Merit calculation comprises **80% weightage for the Pre-Entry Test** and **20% weightage for Intermediate / qualifying examination marks**.",
      "### How to Apply Online",
      "1. Open the university admissions portal at `admissions.saus.edu.pk/admissions`.\n2. Register a new user account with your CNIC/B-Form and active mobile number.\n3. Fill in your personal profile and academic qualifications.\n4. Download and print the **Rs. 2,500 admission processing challan**.\n5. Deposit the challan fee at any designated bank branch.\n6. Upload the stamped paid challan copy onto the portal and finalize submission before **17 October 2026**.",
      "> [!IMPORTANT]\n> **Preservation of Existing Applications:** Candidates who previously submitted their online applications and uploaded paid challans do not need to resubmit. This extension is intended for new applicants and those completing fee uploads.",
