      "### Offered BS Undergraduate Degree Programmes & Eligibility",
      "The Shaikh Ayaz University, Shikarpur (SAUS) offers 4-year undergraduate admissions across the following departments:\n- **BS Computer Science, BS Information Technology & BS Artificial Intelligence:** Intermediate (HSSC Pre-Engineering, Pre-Medical with additional Math/deficiency course, or ICS) with minimum **50% marks**.\n- **BBA (Hons) 4-Year & BS Commerce:** Intermediate (HSSC / I.Com / A-Levels) in any discipline with at least **45%–50% aggregate marks**.\n- **BS English (Language & Literature), BS Mathematics & B.Ed (Hons) 4-Year Elementary:** HSSC or equivalent with minimum **45%–50% marks** as per HEC & NCTE curriculum rules."
