      "To accommodate students graduating under varying board and examination schedules, Isra University operates admissions in progressive cycles:\n- **Hyderabad Campus:** 3 Undergraduate Rounds\n- **Karachi Campus:** 4 Undergraduate Rounds\n- **Islamabad Campus:** 4 Undergraduate Rounds",
