    "id": 336,
    "slug": "lums-electronic-technician-jobs-2026",
    "title": "LUMS Electronic Technician Jobs 2026: Laboratory Engineering Role Guide",
    "category": "private-jobs",
    "organization": "LUMS",
    "jobType": "Contractual Technical Role (PPS-6, PSDP Project)",
    "location": "Laboratory for Nanophysics (NPL), LUMS Lahore, Punjab",
    "qualification": "Diploma in Electrical, Electronics, Instrumentation, or Physics",
    "salary": "PPS-6 Pay Scale (Contractual PSDP Project Package)",
    "experience": "Minimum 1 Year Relevant Technical & Laboratory Experience",
    "positions": "Electronic Technician (PPS-6), Nano Physics Lab (NPL) – NCNN",
    "lastDate": "2026-10-19",
    "noDeadline": false,
    "publishDate": "2026-10-12",
    "officialLink": "https://hr.lums.edu.pk/join-us",
    "applyLink": "https://hr.lums.edu.pk/join-us",
    "isVerified": true,
    "featured": false,
    "logoInitial": "LUMS",
    "featuredImage": "/images/lums-electronic-technician-jobs-2026.webp",
    "imageAlt": "LUMS Electronic Technician jobs 2026 Nano Physics Lab deadline 19 October",
    "excerpt": "Applications Closed (19 October 2026): Reference guide for the contractual Electronic Technician (PPS-6) role at the Laboratory for Nanophysics (NCNN PSDP project), LUMS Lahore, covering DAE qualification, 1-year lab experience, and technical assessment.",
    "content": [
      "> [!NOTE]\n> **Recruitment Status Notice — Applications Closed:**\n> - **Host Institution:** Lahore University of Management Sciences (**LUMS**), DHA, Lahore.\n> - **Research Facility:** Laboratory for Nanophysics (**NPL**) — National Centre for Nanoscience & Nanotechnology (NCNN).\n> - **Post & Pay Scale:** Electronic Technician (**PPS-6**, Contractual PSDP Research Project Role).\n> - **Closing Date:** Online submissions closed on **19 October 2026**.\n> - **Official LUMS Careers Portal:** [hr.lums.edu.pk/join-us](https://hr.lums.edu.pk/join-us).",
      "**Lahore University of Management Sciences (LUMS)** invited applications for a specialized **Electronic Technician (PPS-6)** at its **Laboratory for Nanophysics (NPL)** within the Syed Babar Ali School of Science and Engineering (SBASSE). Funded under the PSDP **National Centre for Nanoscience & Nanotechnology (NCNN)** initiative, the application window closed on **19 October 2026**, and shortlisted technicians are entering practical laboratory evaluations (compare private university hiring standards in our [University of Lahore (UOL) Jobs Guide](/jobs/university-of-lahore-uol-jobs-2026) and engineering placement benchmarks in our [PEC Graduate Engineer Training Guide](/jobs/pec-graduate-engineer-training-get-program-2026)).",
      "## Verified Post Specifications (PPS-6 Contractual Scale)",
      "| Parameter | Official LUMS NCNN Project Specification |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Employer & School** | LUMS — Syed Babar Ali School of Science & Engineering (SBASSE), Lahore |\n| **Assigned Laboratory** | Laboratory for Nanophysics (NPL) |\n| **Appointment Nature** | Contractual Project Position on **PPS-6** (Public Sector Development Programme scale) |\n| **Academic Qualification** | 3-Year **DAE** or B.Tech / BS Diploma in Electronics, Electrical, Instrumentation, or Applied Physics from a recognized technical board/institute |\n| **Mandatory Experience** | Minimum **1 year of relevant hands-on technical & laboratory maintenance experience** |\n| **Selection Mode** | Credential screening followed by practical bench electronics & instrumentation test |",
      "## Practical Laboratory Duties & Technical Bench Evaluation",
      "Unlike general campus electrical maintenance, the NPL Electronic Technician supports sensitive experimental physics, vacuum systems, and low-noise measurement setups. Shortlisted candidates should prepare for hands-on testing in:\n- **Precision Test & Measurement Gear:** Operating digital storage oscilloscopes, lock-in amplifiers, function generators, source-measure units (SMUs), and precision multimeters.\n- **PCB Prototyping & Soldering:** Through-hole and SMD soldering/desoldering, custom sensor signal-conditioning circuits, coaxial/BNC shielding, and grounding noise reduction.\n- **Lab Equipment Diagnostics & Safety:** Routine preventive maintenance of power supplies, temperature controllers, vacuum pump electronics, and high-voltage laboratory safety compliance.",
      "## Project PPS Roles vs. Regular LUMS Staff Careers",
      "Applicants exploring technical careers at LUMS should distinguish between two hiring tracks posted on [hr.lums.edu.pk/join-us](https://hr.lums.edu.pk/join-us):\n- **Externally Funded Research Roles (PPS Scale):** Positions like this **PPS-6 Electronic Technician** are tied to HEC/PSDP project tenures and strictly follow approved PPS pay packages and 1-year baseline experience rules.\n- **Regular University Staff Roles:** Core campus IT, engineering lab, and administrative staff openings follow LUMS's internal university grading and benefits structure.\n- Organize your technical diplomas, PBTE transcripts, and experience letters using our [Documents Checklist Guide in Pakistan 2026](/jobs/government-jobs-documents-checklist-pakistan-2026).",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "### Is the 19 October 2026 LUMS Electronic Technician vacancy still open?\nNo. Applications for this NPL (PPS-6) post closed on **19 October 2026**. Only shortlisted applicants contacted by LUMS HR or the SBASSE Principal Investigator are called for bench testing and interviews.",
      "### Where can DAE Electronics and Physics technicians find active openings?\nMonitor recurring university lab and IT staff postings on [hr.lums.edu.pk/join-us](https://hr.lums.edu.pk/join-us) and browse active technical roles in [Private Sector Jobs in Pakistan](/category/private-jobs)."
    ],
