    "featuredImage": "/images/sbbu-naushahro-feroze-entry-test-2027.webp",
    "imageAlt": "CareerDost.blog editorial banner for SBBU Naushahro Feroze Sub-Campus Entry Test 2027 and merit list guide",
    "excerpt": "Entry Test Concluded (17–18 October 2026): Post-exam reference guide for Shaheed Benazir Bhutto University (SBBU) Naushahro Feroze Sub-Campus Batch 2027 admissions, with direct links to provisional merit lists and scrutiny requirements.",
    "content": [
      "> [!NOTE]\n> **Examination Status Notice — Pre-Entry Test Concluded:**\n> - **University & Campus:** Shaheed Benazir Bhutto University (**SBBU**), Naushahro Feroze (NF) Sub-Campus, Sindh.\n> - **Pre-Entry Test Dates:** Conducted on **17 & 18 October 2026**.\n> - **Current Admission Stage:** Post-test score compilation, provisional merit list display, and original document verification.\n> - **Check Merit Lists Now:** [SBBU Undergraduate Merit List 2027](/jobs/sbbu-merit-list-2027) | [SBBU MS, MPhil & MBA Merit List 2027](/jobs/sbbu-ms-mphil-mba-merit-list-2027) | [Official News Portal](https://sbbusba.edu.pk/sbbu-main/news-updates.html).",
      "Shaheed Benazir Bhutto University (**SBBU**), Shaheed Benazirabad conducted the **Batch 2027 Pre-Entry Test** for its **Naushahro Feroze (NF) Sub-Campus** on **Saturday, 17 October and Sunday, 18 October 2026**. Candidates who appeared in the undergraduate and postgraduate entrance examinations at Naushahro Feroze—as well as applicants from [SBBU Affiliated Colleges](/jobs/sbbu-affiliated-colleges-admissions-2026)—can now track merit selections and complete campus document verification.",
      "## Naushahro Feroze Entry Test Structure & Merit Formula Overview",
      "| Assessment Component | Batch 2027 Examination & Selection Details |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Conducting Body** | Directorate of Admissions, SBBU Shaheed Benazirabad |\n| **Exam Venue** | SBBU Naushahro Feroze Sub-Campus, Naushahro Feroze, Sindh |\n| **Test Dates Concluded** | **17 October & 18 October 2026** (Morning / Scheduled Shifts) |\n| **Core MCQ Sections** | English Comprehension & Grammar, General/Analytical Reasoning, Quantitative Basic Math, and Subject/General Knowledge |\n| **Composite Merit Basis** | Weighted aggregate combining Matric (SSC), Intermediate (HSSC Part-I/II), and SBBU Pre-Entry Test score per university prospectus |",
      "## Next Steps After the 17–18 October Entry Test",
      "Once entry test answer sheets are processed by the SBBU Admissions Committee, seat allocation proceeds through provisional and subsequent merit lists:\n1. **Check Official Merit Lists:** Verify your roll number, aggregate score, and allocated department via [admissions.sbbusba.edu.pk](https://admissions.sbbusba.edu.pk/) or follow our step-by-step [SBBU Undergraduate Merit List 2027 Guide](/jobs/sbbu-merit-list-2027) and [Postgraduate Merit List 2027 Guide](/jobs/sbbu-ms-mphil-mba-merit-list-2027).\n2. **Submit Merit Objections (If Any):** Candidates spotting a clerical discrepancy in HSSC marks or district quota categorization must file an objection with supporting mark sheets within the notified window.\n3. **Pay Admission Challan on Time:** Provisionally selected students must deposit their semester admission fee challan before the list expiry date; unpaid seats roll over automatically to the next waiting list.",
      "## Physical Document Verification File for NF Sub-Campus",
      "Bring original certificates and two attested sets when reporting to the Naushahro Feroze Campus admission desk (check full attestation guidelines in our [Academic & Official Documents Checklist 2026](/jobs/government-jobs-documents-checklist-pakistan-2026)):\n- Original **SBBU Pre-Entry Test Admit Card** stamped at the 17–18 October examination hall.\n- Original **SSC (Matric)** and **HSSC (Intermediate)** marks sheets and pass/provisional certificates.\n- Valid **NADRA CNIC or Form-B**, Father/Guardian CNIC, and District **Domicile & PRC (Form-D)**.\n- Paid bank copy of the SBBU admission processing and semester fee voucher.\n- After enrollment confirmation, eligible students can apply for need-based tuition relief through the [SBBU Shaheed Benazirabad SFAO Scholarship Program](/jobs/sbbu-fully-funded-scholarship-2026).",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "### Will SBBU conduct another Batch 2027 entry test for Naushahro Feroze Campus?\nNo. The scheduled Batch 2027 Pre-Entry Test at Naushahro Feroze Campus concluded on **17–18 October 2026** following the [29 September 2026 registration deadline](/jobs/sbbu-admissions-2026-deadline-extended). Candidates seeking active admissions elsewhere in Sindh can explore [University Admissions in Pakistan](/category/admissions).",
      "### Where can Naushahro Feroze candidates download test results and merit lists?\nOfficial score sheets, provisional merit lists, and waiting-list schedules are posted on [admissions.sbbusba.edu.pk](https://admissions.sbbusba.edu.pk/) and [sbbusba.edu.pk/sbbu-main/news-updates.html](https://sbbusba.edu.pk/sbbu-main/news-updates.html)."
    ],
