    "excerpt": "The Bank of Punjab (BOP) is hiring for managerial positions in Karachi across Digital Banking and Treasury Governance (Band-9 to Band-7). Positions include Regional Manager Alliances and Manager Projects & Governance. Apply online by 29 October 2026.",
    "content": [
      "### Executive Opportunity Overview: Bank of Punjab Karachi Region",
      "**The Bank of Punjab (BOP)**, one of Pakistan's leading commercial banking institutions operating with an expansive nationwide network, has officially announced new managerial career opportunities based at its **Karachi Regional Office**. These openings are situated within the bank’s **Digital Banking Group (Cards & Payment Division)** and the **Treasury & Capital Markets Group (Projects and Governance Division)**.",
      "As commercial banks in Pakistan accelerate cashless payments, fintech integrations, and corporate merchant alliances, BOP is strengthening its strategic business development and institutional governance footprint in Karachi.",
      "**Experience Benchmark:** These positions carry corporate ranking grades of **Band-9 up to Band-7**. Candidates must possess a minimum of **4 years of professional banking or commercial corporate experience**. These vacancies are **strictly intended for experienced professionals, not fresh graduates**.",
      "### Quick Summary Table: BOP Karachi Manager Openings",
      "| Metric / Parameter | Official Specification |\n|:---|:---|\n| **Hiring Institution** | The Bank of Punjab (BOP) |\n| **Available Positions** | Regional Manager Alliances & Manager - Projects and Governance |\n| **Corporate Group / Division** | Digital Banking Group (Cards & Payments) & Treasury & Capital Markets |\n| **Assigned Grade** | Band-9 to Band-7 |\n| **Job Location** | Karachi, Sindh |\n| **Minimum Qualification** | 16-Year Bachelor’s Degree (Master’s preferred) from HEC-recognized university |\n| **Minimum Experience** | 4 Years of Relevant Banking or Corporate Sector Experience |\n| **Maximum Age Limit** | Up to 55 Years as of Closing Date |\n| **Application Deadlines** | **20 October 2026** (Projects & Governance) / **29 October 2026** (Regional Manager Alliances) |\n| **Official Application Portal** | [bop.com.pk/Available-Jobs](https://www.bop.com.pk/Available-Jobs) |",
      "### Key Positions & Core Responsibilities",
      "#### 1. Regional Manager Alliances — Digital Banking Group (Band-9 to Band-7)",
      "- **Location:** Karachi  \n- **Closing Date:** **29 October 2026**  \n- **Core Role:** Spearhead strategic commercial partnerships, merchant acquisition, loyalty discount alliances, and payment brand integrations across Sindh and Southern regions. Manage relationships with major retail brands, e-commerce platforms, and digital payment aggregators to drive debit/credit card usage and acquiring revenue.\n- **Eligibility Criteria:** Minimum Bachelor’s degree (16 years education) in Business Administration, Marketing, Economics, or Commerce from an HEC-recognized institution. Minimum 4 years of proven experience in card alliances, merchant sales, or consumer banking partnerships.",
      "#### 2. Manager - Projects and Governance — Treasury & Capital Markets Group (Band-9)",
      "- **Location:** Karachi  \n- **Closing Date:** **20 October 2026** *(Urgent Filing Window)*  \n- **Core Role:** Drive departmental project governance, portfolio implementation tracking, statutory reporting, and audit compliance across Treasury & Capital Market operations in accordance with State Bank of Pakistan prudential regulations.\n- **Eligibility Criteria:** Minimum Bachelor’s or Master’s degree in Finance, Accounting, Business Administration, or Commerce. Minimum 4 years of solid banking experience with exposure to treasury operations, internal controls, or project management.",
      "### How to Apply Online via the Official BOP Career Portal",
      "Applications must be lodged directly through the Bank of Punjab's official recruitment portal:\n1. **Visit Official Available Jobs:** Go to [https://www.bop.com.pk/Available-Jobs](https://www.bop.com.pk/Available-Jobs).\n2. **Filter by Location:** Select **Karachi** under the location filter to quickly view all regional managerial opportunities.\n3. **Review Role Specifications:** Open the specific job title to confirm detailed responsibilities, grade assignment, and closing date.\n4. **Submit Application:** Click **Apply Online**, complete the structured profile form (including educational credentials, employment timeline, and CNIC number), and upload your latest CV.\n5. **Deadlines Notice:** Ensure the application for Manager Projects & Governance is submitted by **20 October 2026**, and Regional Manager Alliances by **29 October 2026**.",
      "### Anti-Fraud & Regulatory Notice",
      "The Bank of Punjab strictly observes fair-hiring and transparency policies:\n- **No Fees:** BOP **never requests any registration fee, security deposit, or processing charge** during recruitment.\n- **Official Verification:** Always check job notifications directly on `bop.com.pk`. Learn more about our editorial verification standards on the [CareerDost Editorial Policy](/about#editorial-policy).",
      "### Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",
      "**Q1: Can fresh graduates apply for these Bank of Punjab jobs in Karachi?**  \nNo. Both positions require a minimum of 4 years of prior professional banking or commercial experience and are managerial appointments (Band-9/Band-7).\n\n**Q2: What is the maximum age limit for BOP managerial roles?**  \nThe maximum age limit is up to 55 years at the time of the application deadline.\n\n**Q3: Can candidates from other provinces apply for Karachi postings?**  \nYes, candidates possessing the requisite experience who are willing to relocate to Karachi may apply, provided they meet all academic and banking criteria."
    ],
