    "logoInitial": "CBD",
    "featuredImage": "/images/cbd-punjab-youth-career-program-2026.webp",
    "imageAlt": "CBD Punjab Youth Career Program 2026 – Paid Internship for Fresh Graduates — Punjab Central Business District Development Authority (PCBDDA / CBD Punj",
    "excerpt": "Punjab Central Business District Development Authority (PCBDDA / CBD Punjab) has opened applications for the Youth Career Program 2026. A structured, up to 3-month paid internship for fresh graduates with a minimum 3.0 CGPA and max age 25. Apply online before October 12, 2026.",
    "content": [
      "### Program Overview & Authority Mandate",
      "The **Punjab Central Business District Development Authority (PCBDDA)**, prominently known as **CBD Punjab**, is the statutory government body driving Pakistan’s premier master-planned smart urban district and global financial hub. Under its youth empowerment charter, CBD Punjab has officially launched the **Youth Career Program 2026 (YCP 2026)** to recruit ambitious fresh university graduates for an immersive, **up to 3-month paid internship placement**.",
      "Interns will gain direct exposure to mega-infrastructure engineering projects, commercial asset management, advanced GIS mapping, and corporate strategic management at the authority’s headquarters in Lahore.",
      "### Quick Overview Summary Table",
      "- **Administering Authority:** Punjab Central Business District Development Authority (CBD Punjab / PCBDDA)\n- **Initiative Title:** CBD Punjab Youth Career Program 2026 (YCP 2026)\n- **Placement Type:** Paid Graduate Internship\n- **Program Duration:** Up to 3 Months\n- **Office Location:** CBD Punjab Complex, Yasir Shaheed Road, Lahore\n- **Academic Requirement:** Minimum 16 Years of Education (BS / BE / BBA / MA / MSc / LLB)\n- **Minimum CGPA:** 3.0 out of 4.0 (or equivalent 1st Division)\n- **Maximum Age Limit:** 25 Years on application closing date\n- **Target Group:** Fresh Graduates Only\n- **Financial Remuneration:** Monthly Paid Internship Stipend\n- **Application Deadline:** 12 October 2026 (7 Days Remaining)\n- **Official Information Portal:** [cbdpunjab.gov.pk/ycp2026](https://cbdpunjab.gov.pk/ycp2026)\n- **Official Online Application System:** [careers.accelerec.com/career/pcbdda](https://careers.accelerec.com/career/pcbdda)",
      "### Directorates & Eligible Academic Disciplines",
      "Applicants can compete for placement within specific directorates based on their academic qualification:\n\n1. **Finance & Accounting Directorate:**\n   - Eligible Degrees: BBA Finance, BS Accounting & Finance, BSc/MSc Finance, ACCA, CMA, or specialized financial management degree.\n\n2. **IT & Human Resources Directorate:**\n   - Eligible Degrees: Computer Science, Software Engineering, Information Technology, or Human Resource Management.\n\n3. **Legal & Contracts Directorate:**\n   - Eligible Degrees: Bachelor of Laws (LLB), Master of Laws (LLM), or Contracts Management specialization.\n\n4. **Procurement & Supply Chain Directorate:**\n   - Eligible Degrees: Supply Chain Management, Logistics, or Procurement Operations.\n\n5. **Land & Estate Management Directorate:**\n   - Eligible Degrees: Bachelor’s or Master’s degree holders in relevant management or property administration disciplines.\n\n6. **Geographic Information Systems (GIS) Directorate:**\n   - Eligible Degrees: BS / MSc in GIS, Geomatics, Space Sciences, or Remote Sensing.\n\n7. **Audit & Internal Governance Directorate:**\n   - Eligible Degrees: Accounting & Finance, Auditing, Commerce, or professional certifications (ACCA, CA, CMA, CIMA).\n\n8. **Business Development, PR & Marketing:**\n   - Eligible Degrees: Public Relations, Communication Studies, Media Studies, Journalism & Mass Communication, Sales & Marketing.\n\n9. **Engineering & Architecture Directorate:**\n   - Eligible Degrees: Civil Engineering, Electrical Engineering, Architecture, and Urban & Regional Planning.",
      "### Comprehensive Eligibility Criteria",
      "Candidates must fulfill the rigorous standards set by PCBDDA:\n- **Educational Threshold:** Minimum 16 years of completed formal education from an HEC-recognized institution in Pakistan or accredited foreign university.\n- **Academic Performance:** Minimum Cumulative Grade Point Average of **3.0 out of 4.0** (or equivalent 1st Division).\n- **Age Criterion:** Maximum **25 years** as of the closing date, 12 October 2026.\n- **Fresh Graduate Status:** Designed strictly for candidates who have recently completed their degree and are seeking their first career-defining professional immersion.",
      "### Key Benefits & Professional Deliverables",
      "- **Financial Remuneration:** Monthly competitive stipend throughout the 3-month duration.\n- **Official Certificate:** Formal PCBDDA Experience Certificate detailing projects delivered and skills mastered.\n- **Executive Mentorship:** Practical on-site coaching by senior project directors, civil architects, and corporate executives.\n- **Networking Platform:** Direct engagement with multidisciplinary consultants, financial institutions, and contracting consortiums.",
      "### Step-by-Step Application Guide",
      "1. **Visit Official Recruitment Portal:** Access the PCBDDA digital portal at `https://careers.accelerec.com/career/pcbdda`.\n2. **Locate YCP 2026 Listing:** Select **Youth Career Program 2026**.\n3. **Create Account:** Register with your email address and create a secure login.\n4. **Complete Profile Data:** Fill in your academic credentials, degree title, university name, final CGPA, and date of birth.\n5. **Upload Credentials:** Attach an updated curriculum vitae (CV), clear copy of CNIC, and official final transcript showing CGPA 3.0 or above.\n6. **Submit Application:** Finalize submission prior to the official deadline of **October 12, 2026**.",
      "### Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",
      "**Q1: What is the closing date for CBD Punjab Youth Career Program 2026?**\nThe last date to submit online applications is **12 October 2026**.\n\n**Q2: Is the CBD Punjab internship paid?**\nYes. Selected candidates receive a monthly paid stipend during the 3-month internship tenure.\n\n**Q3: What is the minimum CGPA required?**\nCandidates must have a minimum **CGPA of 3.0 out of 4.0** (or equivalent 1st Division).\n\n**Q4: What is the maximum age limit?**\nThe maximum age limit is **25 years** on the application closing date.\n\n**Q5: Are result-awaiting candidates eligible?**\nNo. Only candidates who have successfully graduated with a minimum 16-year degree and available transcript are eligible.\n\n**Q6: Where is the internship located?**\nThe internship takes place at the CBD Punjab Complex, Yasir Shaheed Road, Lahore."
    ],
