      "### Academic Programmes Offered in Fall 2026",
      "UAJK offers 4-year undergraduate BS degree programmes across diverse faculties:\n1. **Computing & Information Technology:** BS Computer Science (BS CS), BS Software Engineering (BS SE), and BS Information Technology (BS IT).\n2. **Sciences & Health:** BS Biotechnology, BS Biochemistry, BS Botany, BS Zoology, BS Chemistry, BS Physics, and BS Mathematics.\n3. **Allied Health Sciences:** Doctor of Physical Therapy (DPT) and Medical Lab Technology.\n4. **Social Sciences & Humanities:** BS English, BS Psychology, BS International Relations, BS Sociology, and BS Economics.\n5. **Business & Commerce:** BBA (Honors), BS Commerce, and BS Public Administration.",
