    "title": "PIDCL Site Engineer Jobs 2026: Civil Engineering Vacancies via National Job Portal",
    "category": "government-jobs",
    "organization": "Pakistan Infrastructure Development Company Ltd. (PIDCL), Govt of Pakistan",
    "jobType": "Federal Government Contract (NJP Job ID 9777)",
    "location": "Islamabad & Karachi Test Centers (Nationwide Deployment)",
    "qualification": "B.E. / B.Sc Civil Engineering + Valid PEC Registration",
    "salary": "Lump-Sum Market Competitive Pay Package",
    "experience": "3 to 5 Years Post-Qualification Civil Infrastructure Experience",
    "positions": "05 Posts — Site Engineer (Civil)",
    "lastDate": "2026-10-11",
    "noDeadline": false,
    "publishDate": "2026-10-03",
    "officialLink": "https://njp.gov.pk/jobs/9777",
    "applyLink": "https://www.njp.gov.pk/",
    "isVerified": true,
    "featured": true,
    "logoInitial": "PIDCL",
    "featuredImage": "/images/pidcl-site-engineer-jobs-2026.webp",
    "imageAlt": "CareerDost.blog editorial banner for PIDCL Site Engineer Civil recruitment and NJP scrutiny guide",
    "excerpt": "Applications Closed (11 October 2026): Official reference and NJP shortlisting guide for Pakistan Infrastructure Development Company Ltd. (PIDCL) Site Engineer (Civil) vacancies (NJP Job ID 9777), including PEC verification and scrutiny checklist.",
    "content": [
      "> [!NOTE]\n> **Recruitment Status Notice — Applications Closed:**\n> - **Employer:** Pakistan Infrastructure Development Company Limited (PIDCL), Government of Pakistan.\n> - **Post Advertised:** Site Engineer (Civil) — 05 Contractual Positions (NJP Job ID `9777`).\n> - **Closing Date:** Online applications closed on **11 October 2026**.\n> - **Current Stage:** Departmental scrutiny of NJP profiles, PEC registration validity, and test/interview shortlisting for Islamabad and Karachi centers.\n> - **Official Portals:** [National Job Portal (njp.gov.pk)](https://www.njp.gov.pk/) | [pidcl.com.pk](https://pidcl.com.pk/).",
      "Pakistan Infrastructure Development Company Limited (**PIDCL**)—a federal public-sector development company executing urban roads, bridges, rapid transit corridors, and civil works across Pakistan—advertised **05 Site Engineer (Civil)** vacancies through the [National Job Portal (NJP)](https://www.njp.gov.pk/). While the online application window closed on **11 October 2026**, candidates who applied are now in the departmental scrutiny and shortlisting phase.",
      "## Historical Vacancy Summary & Eligibility Benchmark",
      "| Recruitment Parameter | Official Advertised Specification |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Hiring Organization** | Pakistan Infrastructure Development Company Ltd. (PIDCL), Islamabad |\n| **Post Title & Count** | Site Engineer (Civil) — **05 Vacancies** |\n| **Application Gateway** | National Job Portal (`njp.gov.pk/jobs/9777`) |\n| **Academic Requirement** | B.E. / B.Sc. in Civil Engineering (16 years) from an HEC-recognized university |\n| **Statutory Council License** | Active Registration with [Pakistan Engineering Council (PEC)](https://www.pec.org.pk) (RE / PE) |\n| **Relevant Experience** | Field supervision in roadworks, bridges, concrete structures, QA/QC, and IPC billing |\n| **Designated Test/Interview Hubs** | Islamabad & Karachi (with nationwide project deployment) |",
      "## How Shortlisted Engineers Can Track Status on NJP",
      "PIDCL processes applicant shortlisting through its recruitment committee and updates candidate status via the NITB portal:\n1. Sign in to [https://www.njp.gov.pk](https://www.njp.gov.pk) using your registered 13-digit CNIC and password.\n2. Open **Applied Jobs** on your candidate dashboard and locate **Site Engineer (Civil) — PIDCL**.\n3. Watch both your NJP dashboard and registered email/SMS for written/technical test or interview call letters.\n4. Review our guide on [NJP Application Rejection: 12 Common Mistakes Pakistani Applicants Should Avoid](/jobs/njp-application-rejection-12-common-mistakes-avoid) to understand how federal engineering committees evaluate post-qualification experience and PEC records.",
      "## Scrutiny & Interview Document File for Civil Engineers",
      "Candidates called for test or interview at PIDCL's Islamabad (`26 Mauve Area, G-9/1`) or Karachi centers must present original credentials alongside attested copies. Prepare your physical dossier using our [Government Jobs Documents Checklist in Pakistan 2026](/jobs/government-jobs-documents-checklist-pakistan-2026) and verify readiness on the [Government Job Application Readiness Checker](/tools/job-readiness-checker):\n- Original unexpired **NADRA CNIC** and District **Domicile Certificate** (plus PRC Form-D for Sindh domicile holders).\n- HEC-attested **B.E. / B.Sc. Civil Engineering degree** and final university transcript/DMC.\n- Valid **PEC Registration Certificate / Renewal Card** valid as of the closing date (`11 October 2026`).\n- Signed **post-qualification experience certificates** on employer letterhead specifying exact `DD-MM-YYYY` tenure on civil/highway projects (appointment offers alone do not prove completed service).\n- **Departmental NOC** if currently serving in any federal, provincial, or autonomous government organization.",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "### Can new candidates still submit applications for PIDCL Job ID 9777?\nNo. The National Job Portal automatically disabled applications after **11 October 2026**. Engineers seeking currently open public-sector roles should check live listings under [Government Jobs in Pakistan](/category/government-jobs) or graduate training routes such as the [PEC Graduate Engineer Training (GET) Program Guide](/jobs/pec-graduate-engineer-training-get-program-2026).",
      "### Why is PEC registration strictly checked during PIDCL scrutiny?\nUnder the Pakistan Engineering Council Act, practicing professional civil engineering supervision on federal infrastructure projects legally requires active PEC registration (`Registered Engineer` or `Professional Engineer`). Applications lacking a valid PEC number at scrutiny are routinely disqualified."
    ],
    "seoTitle": "PIDCL Site Engineer Jobs 2026 (Closed) — NJP Scrutiny Guide",
