      "6. **Step 6:** Dispatch the printed hard-copy application form along with attested copies of degrees, transcripts, CNIC, PEC certificate, and paid fee receipt to the **Registrar Office, UET Lahore** before the advertised deadline.",
      "### Frequently Asked Questions (FAQ)",
      "**Q1: How can I apply for UET Lahore faculty jobs?**\nCandidates must complete online registration on `https://jobs.uet.edu.pk/` AND submit hard copies of their application to the Registrar Office.",
      "**Q2: Is PEC registration mandatory for engineering posts?**\nYes, active registration with Pakistan Engineering Council (PEC) is mandatory for all engineering discipline faculty and lab positions."
