    "excerpt": "Admissions Closed (29 September 2026): Complete Session 2026–27 admission archive for Shaheed Benazir Bhutto University (SBBU), Shaheed Benazirabad, with direct links to Batch 2027 BS, LLB, MBA, and MS/MPhil merit lists.",
    "content": [
      "> [!NOTE]\n> **Admission Cycle Status — Session 2026–27 Applications Closed:**\n> - **University:** Shaheed Benazir Bhutto University (**SBBU**), Shaheed Benazirabad (Nawabshah), Sindh.\n> - **Campuses:** Main Campus Nawabshah, Sanghar Campus, and Naushahro Feroze Campus.\n> - **Extended Closing Date:** Online registration closed on **29 September 2026**.\n> - **Next Stage (Merit Lists Published):** Check your selection status in the [SBBU Undergraduate Merit List 2027](/jobs/sbbu-merit-list-2027) and [SBBU MS, MPhil & MBA Merit List 2027](/jobs/sbbu-ms-mphil-mba-merit-list-2027).",
      "Shaheed Benazir Bhutto University (**SBBU**), Shaheed Benazirabad concluded its extended online application window for **Academic Session 2026–27 (Batch 2027)** on **29 September 2026**. Following pre-entry tests at Main Campus, Sanghar, and the [Naushahro Feroze Sub-Campus Entry Test](/jobs/sbbu-naushahro-feroze-entry-test-2027), the Directorate of Admissions has transitioned to merit list publication, original document scrutiny, and semester fee confirmation.",
      "## Academic Programs Offered Across SBBU Campuses (Batch 2027)",
      "| Degree Level | Offered Disciplines & Campuses | Baseline Academic Requirement |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **BS (4-Year) & BBA** | Information Technology, Computer Science, Software Engineering, English, Media Studies, Business Administration, Economics, Chemistry, Molecular Biology (Nawabshah, Sanghar & NF Campuses) | HSSC (Intermediate) or IBCC equivalent with minimum 45%–50% marks per HEC/program rules + SBBU Pre-Entry Test |\n| **LLB (5-Year)** | Law (regulated per HEC & Pakistan Bar Council standards) | HSSC Intermediate + valid HEC **Law Admission Test (LAT)** qualifying score |\n| **MS / MPhil & MBA** | Computer Science, Information Technology, English Linguistics, Education, Sindhi, Business Administration | Relevant 16-year degree (minimum 2.50 CGPA / 2nd Division) + departmental/GAT assessment |\n| **PhD Programs** | Selected research faculties at Main Campus Shaheed Benazirabad | Relevant 18-year MS/MPhil thesis degree (minimum 3.00 CGPA) + GAT Subject / institutional PhD test |",
      "## Post-Test Merit Lists, Affiliated Colleges & Financial Aid",
      "Applicants who registered before the **29 September 2026** cutoff can track their post-test milestones across SBBU's official channels on [admissions.sbbusba.edu.pk](https://admissions.sbbusba.edu.pk/):\n- **Undergraduate BS Merit Lists:** View Campus and District quota selections in our [SBBU Merit List 2027 Download & Verification Guide](/jobs/sbbu-merit-list-2027).\n- **Postgraduate Selections:** Graduate candidates should consult the [SBBU MS, MPhil & MBA Merit List 2027 Guide](/jobs/sbbu-ms-mphil-mba-merit-list-2027).\n- **Affiliated Colleges Route:** Students seeking admission in public degree colleges affiliated with SBBU can review [SBBU Affiliated Colleges Admissions 2026](/jobs/sbbu-affiliated-colleges-admissions-2026).\n- **Tuition Support:** Once enrolled, deserving students can apply for SEEF, HEC Need-Based, or Zakat waivers detailed in our [SBBU Shaheed Benazirabad SFAO Scholarship Guide](/jobs/sbbu-fully-funded-scholarship-2026).",
      "## Required Documents for Admission Confirmation & Scrutiny",
      "Selected candidates must bring originals plus attested photocopies to the Directorate of Admissions within the notified fee-payment window (review attestation rules in our [Documents Checklist Guide 2026](/jobs/government-jobs-documents-checklist-pakistan-2026)):\n- Printed SBBU online admission form, paid pre-entry test challan, and admit card.\n- Original **SSC (Matric)** and **HSSC (Intermediate)** pacca certificates and marks sheets (plus 16-year transcripts for MS/MPhil/MBA).\n- Candidate **NADRA CNIC / Form-B**, Father/Guardian CNIC, and Sindh **Domicile & PRC (Form-D)**.\n- Valid **HEC LAT scorecard** (strictly for LLB applicants) and four passport-size photographs.",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "### Are late online forms still accepted for SBBU Batch 2027?\nNo. The extended portal deadline closed on **29 September 2026**. Candidates looking for currently open university intakes in Sindh can apply to [Isra University Spring 2027 Undergraduate Admissions](/jobs/isra-university-spring-2027-undergraduate-admissions) or browse [University Admissions in Pakistan](/category/admissions).",
      "### Where are official SBBU merit lists and fee challans issued?\nAll official provisional and final merit lists, objection windows, and admission fee vouchers are published on [admissions.sbbusba.edu.pk](https://admissions.sbbusba.edu.pk/) and [sbbusba.edu.pk](https://sbbusba.edu.pk/)."
    ],
