    "positions": "15 Regular Posts — Assistant (BPS-15)",
    "lastDate": "2026-10-10",
    "noDeadline": false,
    "publishDate": "2026-09-27",
    "officialLink": "https://navttc.gov.pk/",
    "applyLink": "https://www.njp.gov.pk/",
    "isVerified": false,
    "featured": true,
    "logoInitial": "NAV",
    "featuredImage": "/images/navttc-assistant-bps15-2026.webp",
    "imageAlt": "NAVTTC Jobs 2026 Assistant BPS 15 Recruitment 15 Vacancies CareerDost",
    "excerpt": "Applications Closed (10 October 2026): Reference guide for 15 regular Assistant (BPS-15) vacancies at NAVTTC via the National Job Portal (njp.gov.pk), covering screening test pattern, NITB IT training rules, and scrutiny documents.",
    "content": [
      "> [!NOTE]\n> **Recruitment Status Notice — Applications Closed:**\n> - **Hiring Commission:** National Vocational & Technical Training Commission ([NAVTTC](https://navttc.gov.pk/)), Ministry of Federal Education & Professional Training.\n> - **Post Advertised:** Assistant (BPS-15) — **15 Regular Federal Vacancies**.\n> - **Closing Date:** Online submissions closed on **10 October 2026**.\n> - **Current Stage:** Candidate scrutiny and screening test / roll-number slip updates via [njp.gov.pk](https://www.njp.gov.pk/).",
      "The **National Vocational and Technical Training Commission (NAVTTC)** advertised **15 regular posts of Assistant (BPS-15)** alongside senior secretarial ([Assistant Private Secretary BPS-16](/jobs/navttc-assistant-private-secretary-jobs-2026)) and executive ([Director BPS-18](/jobs/navttc-director-bps18-jobs-2026)) vacancies. Although online applications closed on **10 October 2026**, thousands of graduate applicants are now preparing for the written screening test and document verification stage.",
      "## Post Specifications & Federal Quota Rules",
      "| Recruitment Parameter | Official BPS-15 Specification |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Employer** | National Vocational & Technical Training Commission (NAVTTC), Islamabad |\n| **Designation & Scale** | Assistant (**BPS-15**, Regular Federal Scale) |\n| **Total Advertised Seats** | **15 Vacancies** (Federal Merit & Provincial/Regional Quotas) |\n| **Academic Qualification** | Second Class or Grade 'C' Bachelor's Degree (14 or 16 years) from an HEC-recognized university |\n| **Age Limit** | 18–28 years plus 5 years general federal relaxation (**up to 33 years** on closing date) |\n| **Mandatory Probation Rule** | Completion of 6-week Basic IT Training Course (including MS Office) conducted by NITB within 1 year |",
      "## Written Screening Test Focus & Operational Duties",
      "Assistants in BPS-15 handle ministerial noting, summary drafting, accreditation file tracking, and inter-provincial TVET coordination at NAVTTC Headquarters and regional offices. Candidates preparing for the screening test should focus on:\n- **English Grammar & Official Drafting:** Precis basics, sentence correction, prepositions, vocabulary, and office memorandum formatting.\n- **General Knowledge & Pakistan Affairs:** Constitutional bodies, federal ministries, geography of Pakistan, Islamiyat/Ethics, and current affairs.\n- **Basic Quantitative & Everyday Science:** Percentages, ratios, averages, and analytical MCQs.\n- **Computer & MS Office Fundamentals:** MS Word formatting, Excel formulas, PowerPoint, and e-Office/email operations.",
      "## How to Check NJP Shortlisting & Prepare Scrutiny Documents",
      "Log in regularly to your **Applied Jobs** tab on [https://www.njp.gov.pk](https://www.njp.gov.pk) and check announcements on [navttc.gov.pk](https://navttc.gov.pk/) for test center allocations and roll-number slips.\n- **Avoid Scrutiny Disqualification:** Review [NJP Application Rejection: 12 Common Mistakes to Avoid](/jobs/njp-application-rejection-12-common-mistakes-avoid) to verify how domicile urban/rural sub-quotas and academic declaration dates are checked.\n- **Assemble Your Attested Folder:** Keep your valid CNIC, District Domicile (and PRC Form-D where applicable), Matric/Inter/Bachelor transcripts, and passport photos ready using our [Government Jobs Documents Checklist in Pakistan 2026](/jobs/government-jobs-documents-checklist-pakistan-2026) and [Job Application Readiness Checker](/tools/job-readiness-checker).",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "### Was the 6-week NITB IT certificate required before applying on 10 October 2026?\nNo. Under Federal Establishment Division recruitment rules for BPS-15 Assistants, selected candidates who do not already hold an NITB Basic IT certificate complete the mandatory 6-week NITB course during their 1-year probation period after appointment.",
      "### Are new NAVTTC administrative vacancies currently open?\nThe October 2026 recruitment drive is closed. You can browse live federal and provincial openings on [Government Jobs in Pakistan](/category/government-jobs) or explore skill-training initiatives in our [Benazir Hunarmand & NAVTTC Training Guide](/jobs/benazir-hunarmand-programme-2026-karachi-guide)."
    ],
