    "excerpt": "Applications Closed (06 October 2026): Reference and interview guide for The Bank of Punjab (BOP) Relationship Officer – Transaction Banking Sales (South) in Karachi, covering corporate cash management duties, SBP compliance, and portal tracking.",
    "content": [
      "> [!NOTE]\n> **Recruitment Status Notice — Applications Closed:**\n> - **Employer:** The Bank of Punjab (**BOP**).\n> - **Designation:** Relationship Officer — Transaction Banking Sales (South).\n> - **Duty Station:** Karachi, Sindh.\n> - **Closing Date:** Online submissions closed on **06 October 2026**.\n> - **Current Stage:** HR shortlisting and panel interviews; monitor new banking vacancies at [bop.com.pk/Available-Jobs](https://www.bop.com.pk/Available-Jobs).",
      "**The Bank of Punjab (BOP)**—one of Pakistan's fastest-growing AA+ rated scheduled commercial banks—invited applications for **Relationship Officer – Transaction Banking Sales (South)** based in **Karachi**. While online registration closed on **06 October 2026**, shortlisted candidates are preparing for technical commercial banking interviews, and banking professionals in Sindh can use this guide to benchmark BOP's transaction banking requirements.",
      "## Role Specifications & Eligibility Benchmarks",
      "| Parameter | Official BOP Recruitment Standard |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Bank & Division** | The Bank of Punjab — Corporate & Transaction Banking Group (South) |\n| **Location** | Karachi, Sindh |\n| **Academic Requirement** | Bachelor's (16-year) or Master's / MBA degree in Banking, Finance, Commerce, Business Administration, or Economics from an HEC-recognized university |\n| **Preferred Experience** | Prior banking sales, corporate cash management, employee banking, or liability mobilization experience |\n| **Compensation Structure** | Market-competitive BOP grade package, performance incentives & medical/provident benefits |",
      "## Core Transaction Banking Responsibilities & Interview Topics",
      "Transaction Banking differs from pure retail branch operations by focusing on high-volume corporate liquidity, digital collections, and payment automation. Candidates called for BOP panel interviews in Karachi should prepare across four operational pillars:\n- **Cash Management & Digital Collections:** Structuring corporate collection mandates, API/host-to-host ERP integrations, virtual accounts, and nationwide dealer collection networks.\n- **Corporate Disbursements & Payroll:** Onboarding institutional clients onto bulk vendor payment portals and corporate employee payroll packages.\n- **CASA & Float Mobilization:** Growing low-cost Current and Savings Account (CASA) float balances through sticky operational cash flows.\n- **SBP Regulatory & AML/KYC Compliance:** Ensuring corporate onboarding files strictly satisfy **State Bank of Pakistan (SBP)** AML/CFT, ultimate beneficial ownership (UBO), and KYC directives.",
      "## Checking Status & Preparing Verification Documents",
      "Candidates who applied via [bop.com.pk/Available-Jobs](https://www.bop.com.pk/Available-Jobs) receive interview call notifications directly from BOP Human Resources via registered email and phone.\n- **Interview Dossier:** Keep your original NADRA CNIC, HEC-recognized university transcripts/degrees, previous bank service letters/experience proofs, and recent pay slips organized (see our [Official Documents Checklist Guide 2026](/jobs/government-jobs-documents-checklist-pakistan-2026)).\n- **Related BOP & Karachi Banking Guides:** Compare corporate credit tracks in [BOP Relationship Manager & Officer (CFC) Jobs Guide](/jobs/bank-of-punjab-relationship-manager-officer-cfc-jobs-2026), [BOP Karachi Manager Jobs Guide](/jobs/bank-of-punjab-karachi-manager-jobs-2026), and [Bank AL Habib Relationship Manager Jobs](/jobs/bank-al-habib-relationship-manager-jobs-2026-apply-online).",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "### Can candidates submit offline CVs after the 06 October 2026 deadline?\nNo. The Bank of Punjab exclusively accepts applications submitted online through [bop.com.pk/Available-Jobs](https://www.bop.com.pk/Available-Jobs) before the advertised cutoff date; emailed or walk-in CVs are not entertained.",
      "### Where can I find currently open commercial bank jobs in Karachi and across Pakistan?\nBrowse verified active trainee, teller, and relationship management openings in [Bank Jobs in Pakistan](/category/bank-jobs)."
    ],
