    "title": "Karachi Shipyard (KS&EW) Technical Assistant Jobs 2026: Career & Eligibility Guide",
    "category": "government-jobs",
    "organization": "Karachi Shipyard & Engineering Works (KSEW)",
    "jobType": "Full Time / Contract",
    "location": "Karachi, Sindh",
    "qualification": "DAE (Mechanical / Naval Architecture / Shipbuilding) from a recognized Board",
    "salary": "Market Competitive Salary Package with KSEW Benefits",
    "experience": "1 to 3 Years Shipyard, Heavy Fabrication, or Industrial Maintenance Experience",
    "positions": "Technical Assistant (Shipbuilding / Mechanical / Marine / Electrical)",
    "lastDate": "2026-10-10",
    "noDeadline": false,
    "publishDate": "2026-09-27",
    "officialLink": "https://www.karachishipyard.com.pk/page/careers",
    "applyLink": "https://www.karachishipyard.com.pk/page/careers",
    "isVerified": false,
    "featured": true,
    "logoInitial": "KS",
    "featuredImage": "/images/karachi-shipyard-technical-assistant-2026.webp",
    "imageAlt": "Karachi Shipyard Technical Assistant Jobs 2026 – Apply Online — Karachi Shipyard & Engineering Works (KSEW) Official Notice CareerDost",
    "excerpt": "Applications Closed (October 2026 Intake): Career and trade-test reference guide for Karachi Shipyard & Engineering Works (KS&EW) Technical Assistant posts at West Wharf, Karachi, including DAE scrutiny and recurring portal updates.",
    "content": [
      "> [!NOTE]\n> **Recruitment Status Notice — October 2026 Batch Closed:**\n> - **Employer:** Karachi Shipyard & Engineering Works Limited (**KS&EW**), West Wharf, Karachi (under Ministry of Defence Production).\n> - **Post:** Technical Assistant (Shipbuilding, Mechanical, Electrical & Fabrication).\n> - **Status:** The early-October 2026 recruitment batch (**closed October 2026**) has concluded its application window and moved to credential scrutiny and trade testing.\n> - **Official Careers Portal (Check New Batches):** [karachishipyard.com.pk/page/careers](https://www.karachishipyard.com.pk/page/careers).",
      "**Karachi Shipyard & Engineering Works Limited (KS&EW)**—Pakistan's premier maritime engineering, commercial vessel construction, and naval shipbuilding complex at West Wharf, Karachi—periodically recruits **Technical Assistants** and Associate Engineers on contractual/project scales. While the October 2026 intake covered by this notice has closed, shortlisted diploma holders are preparing for practical trade assessments, and prospective Karachi technicians can monitor recurring batches directly on KS&EW's official careers page.",
      "## Technical Assistant Eligibility & Role Profile",
      "| Parameter | Verified KS&EW Specification |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Hiring Organization** | Karachi Shipyard & Engineering Works Ltd. (KS&EW) |\n| **Duty Station** | West Wharf Dockyard, Karachi, Sindh |\n| **Academic Qualification** | 3-Year **Diploma of Associate Engineering (DAE)** in Mechanical, Marine, Naval Architecture, Electrical, or Metallurgy from SBTE / PBTE / recognized Technical Board |\n| **Relevant Experience** | Hands-on experience in heavy steel fabrication, marine piping, CNC/lathe machining, welding inspection, or industrial electrical maintenance |\n| **Employment Mode** | Contractual package with KS&EW allowances per company rules |",
      "## Practical Trade Test & Dockyard Assessment Guide",
      "Shortlisted DAE holders at KS&EW typically undergo a two-part evaluation at the **Shipyard Technical Training Centre (TTC), West Wharf**:\n- **Technical Drawing & Metrology:** Reading marine hull blueprints, isometric piping diagrams, vernier caliper/micrometer tolerances, and welding symbols.\n- **Shop-Floor Trade & NDT Basics:** Understanding SMAW/MIG/TIG welding quality checks, Non-Destructive Testing (dye-penetrant and ultrasonic thickness checks), pump/shaft alignment, and electrical motor control panels.\n- **Dry-Dock Safety (OHS):** Strict adherence to confined-space entry, scaffolding safety, hot-work permits, and marine electrical isolation procedures.",
      "## Required Verification Documents for Shortlisted Candidates",
      "Candidates called for trade test or interview in Karachi should carry originals plus two attested photocopy sets (organize your folder with our [Government Jobs Documents Checklist in Pakistan 2026](/jobs/government-jobs-documents-checklist-pakistan-2026) and [Job Application Readiness Checker](/tools/job-readiness-checker)):\n- Valid **NADRA CNIC** and **Domicile / PRC (Form-D)**.\n- Matric certificate and complete 3-year **DAE Diploma & annual marks sheets** issued by Sindh Board of Technical Education (SBTE) or respective provincial technical board.\n- **Experience / Trade Certificates** on employer letterhead (plus naval/defence discharge book if claiming ex-serviceman experience relaxation).\n- Recent passport-size photographs and printed copy of submitted KS&EW application form.",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "### How often does Karachi Shipyard announce Technical Assistant jobs?\nKS&EW advertises technical, supervisory, and dock-maintenance vacancies in periodic batches based on active shipbuilding and submarine/vessel overhaul schedules. Always check [karachishipyard.com.pk/page/careers](https://www.karachishipyard.com.pk/page/careers) directly within 15 days of newspaper publication.",
      "### What other maritime or public-sector technical jobs can Karachi candidates explore?\nExplore related maritime and federal technical guides on CareerDost, including [PNSC Karachi Shipping Jobs Guide](/jobs/pnsc-jobs-2026-karachi-shipping), [Gwadar Shipyard Recruitment Guide](/jobs/gwadar-shipyard-assistant-jobs-2026), and live listings in [Government Jobs in Pakistan](/category/government-jobs)."
    ],
    "seoTitle": "Karachi Shipyard Technical Assistant Jobs 2026 — Guide",
