    "excerpt": "Applications Closed (30 September 2026): Reference and interview guide for IMARAT Group of Companies Paid Finance Internship in Islamabad/Rawalpindi, covering corporate accounts duties, Excel/tax skills, and active internship alternatives.",
    "content": [
      "> [!NOTE]\n> **Internship Status Notice — Applications Closed:**\n> - **Employer:** IMARAT Group of Companies.\n> - **Role:** Paid Finance Intern (Corporate Finance & Accounts).\n> - **Location:** Islamabad / Rawalpindi.\n> - **Closing Date:** Online submissions closed on **30 September 2026** (`JobID 2547`).\n> - **Official Careers Portal (Check New Openings):** [careers.imarat.com.pk](https://careers.imarat.com.pk/).",
      "**IMARAT Group of Companies**—a major real estate development, hospitality, and PropTech group headquartered in the Islamabad/Rawalpindi region—offered a **Paid Finance Internship** for fresh accounting and finance graduates. While applications for the September 2026 cohort closed on **30 September 2026**, shortlisted candidates and aspiring finance interns can use this guide to understand corporate real-estate finance workflows and technical interview expectations.",
      "## Internship Profile & Eligibility Summary",
      "| Parameter | Official IMARAT Finance Internship Specification |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **Hiring Organization** | IMARAT Group of Companies (Finance & Accounts Division) |\n| **Duty Station** | Twin Cities (Islamabad / Rawalpindi) |\n| **Eligible Qualifications** | Fresh Graduates or Final-Semester Students in **BS Accounting & Finance, BBA (Finance), B.Com (Hons)**, or **ACCA / CA (CAF)** trainees |\n| **Core Software Skills** | Intermediate-to-advanced **MS Excel** (PivotTables, XLOOKUP/VLOOKUP, reconciliations) & ERP familiarity |\n| **Compensation** | Monthly paid internship stipend with conversion potential based on evaluation |",
      "## Core Corporate Finance Tasks & Interview Preparation",
      "In large real-estate and construction groups, finance interns work across project cost centers, vendor payables, and client installment ledgers. Candidates preparing for corporate finance internship interviews should brush up on:\n- **Accounts Payable & Receivable Reconciliations:** Matching contractor IPCs/invoices with purchase orders, verifying bank ledger reconciliations, and tracking customer installment schedules.\n- **Pakistani Withholding Tax & Sales Tax Basics:** Understanding baseline FBR withholding tax (WHT) deductions on goods, services, and contracts under Section 153 of the Income Tax Ordinance.\n- **Financial Modeling & Reporting:** Cleaning multi-sheet trial balances in MS Excel, preparing monthly cash-flow summaries, and assisting senior analysts with budget variance reports.",
      "## Documents to Keep Ready & Active Internship Alternatives",
      "Candidates called for HR screening in Islamabad should carry their updated one-page CV, NADRA CNIC, university transcripts (or ACCA exam status report), and university internship referral letter if still enrolled (organize your credentials using our [Official Documents Checklist Guide 2026](/jobs/government-jobs-documents-checklist-pakistan-2026)).\n- **Explore Related Paid Internships:** Review our guides on the [Punjab CBD Youth Career Paid Internship](/jobs/punjab-cbd-youth-career-program-2026-internship), [EZY Business Applications Paid Internship](/jobs/ezy-business-applications-paid-internship-karachi-2026), and [Planning Commission Internship Guide](/jobs/planning-commission-internship-2026).",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "### Is Job ID 2547 on the IMARAT careers portal still accepting applications?\nNo. The September 2026 Finance Intern listing closed on **30 September 2026**. Prospective candidates can create a talent profile and check newly posted roles at [careers.imarat.com.pk](https://careers.imarat.com.pk/).",
      "### Where can BBA, BS Finance, and ACCA students find active internships in Pakistan?\nBrowse verified public and corporate training programs in [Internships in Pakistan](/category/internships) and graduate trainee opportunities in [Bank Jobs](/category/bank-jobs)."
    ],
