    "title": "University of Lahore (UOL) Jobs 2026: Teaching Faculty & Hospital Staff Recruitment Guide",
    "category": "private-jobs",
    "organization": "University of Lahore (UOL)",
    "jobType": "Full Time",
    "location": "Lahore, Punjab",
    "qualification": "MBBS / FCPS / MPhil / PhD / Master’s / BS IT",
    "salary": "Competitive Academic & Hospital Pay Scale",
    "experience": "HEC Academic Publication/Teaching Criteria or PM&DC Clinical Post-Fellowship Experience",
    "positions": "Professor, Associate/Assistant Professor, Lecturer, Senior Registrar & Allied Health Staff",
    "lastDate": "2026-10-10",
    "noDeadline": false,
    "publishDate": "2026-09-27",
    "officialLink": "https://careers.uol.edu.pk/",
    "applyLink": "https://careers.uol.edu.pk/",
    "isVerified": true,
    "featured": true,
    "logoInitial": "UL",
    "featuredImage": "/images/uol-lahore-university-jobs-2026.webp",
    "imageAlt": "CareerDost.blog editorial banner for University of Lahore UOL academic faculty and teaching hospital careers guide",
    "excerpt": "October 2026 Phase Closed (Rolling Portal Active): Career and eligibility guide for The University of Lahore (UOL) and UOL Teaching Hospital covering HEC faculty criteria, PM&DC clinical credentials, and online applications via careers.uol.edu.pk.",
    "content": [
      "> [!NOTE]\n> **Recruitment Status Notice — October 2026 Phase Concluded:**\n> - **Employer:** The University of Lahore (**UOL**) & The University of Lahore Teaching Hospital, Defence Road, Lahore.\n> - **Advertised Batch Cutoff:** The October 2026 consolidated advertisement closed on **10 October 2026**.\n> - **Rolling Careers Portal:** UOL posts new departmental and clinical vacancies year-round at [careers.uol.edu.pk](https://careers.uol.edu.pk/).",
      "**The University of Lahore (UOL)**—one of Pakistan's largest chartered private-sector universities operating multidisciplinary academic faculties alongside its **UOL Teaching Hospital**—concluded its early-October faculty and clinical recruitment batch on **10 October 2026**. Shortlisted academics and specialist clinicians from that cycle are undergoing demonstration lectures and medical board interviews, while prospective applicants can track rolling departmental openings on UOL's official careers portal.",
      "## Academic & Clinical Recruitment Streams at UOL",
      "| Hiring Wing | Advertised Designations | Baseline Qualification & Experience | Statutory Regulator |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Professorial & Senior Faculty** | Professor, Associate Professor, Assistant Professor | PhD in Engineering, CS, Management, Law, Pharmacy, or Basic Sciences + HEC-recognized HJRS research publications & university teaching tenure | [Higher Education Commission (HEC)](https://www.hec.gov.pk) |\n| **Junior Teaching Faculty** | Lecturer / Junior Lecturer / Lab Engineer | MS / MPhil (18-year) or PEC-registered BS (for Lab Engineer) with strong academic CGPA | HEC / PEC / Relevant Accreditation Council |\n| **Clinical Teaching Hospital** | Consultant, Senior Registrar, Medical Officer, Nursing Staff | MBBS + FCPS / MS / MD (or PNC license for Nursing) with valid clinical house-job/training record | [PM&DC](https://pmdc.pk) / PNC |\n| **Allied Health & Diagnostics** | Clinical Technologist, Physiotherapist, Radiographer | BS / DPT / MS in Medical Lab Technology, Diagnostic Radiology, or Rehabilitation Sciences | Allied Health Professionals Council (AHPC) |",
      "## Mandatory Regulatory Scrutiny (HEC, PM&DC & PEC)",
      "Private chartered universities and teaching hospitals face periodic statutory inspections, meaning UOL's HR and Dean committees strictly verify regulatory credentials before issuing appointment letters:\n- **HEC Faculty Appointment Criteria:** Candidates for Assistant, Associate, and Full Professor must satisfy HEC's minimum PhD, teaching/industrial experience, and **HJRS (HEC Journal Recognition System)** publication counts; foreign PhDs require an **HEC Equivalence Certificate**.\n- **PM&DC Registration & Experience Certificates:** Clinical faculty and Senior Registrars at UOL Teaching Hospital must hold active permanent **PM&DC registration** including recognition of their postgraduate fellowship (FCPS/MD/MS).\n- **Teaching Demonstration (Micro-Teaching):** Shortlisted Lecturers and Assistant Professors deliver a 15–20 minute subject lecture and research plan presentation before the departmental selection panel.",
      "## How to Use the UOL Careers Portal & Prepare Documents",
      "1. Visit [careers.uol.edu.pk](https://careers.uol.edu.pk/) to check live departmental openings or track previously submitted applications.\n2. Maintain a single updated candidate profile with chronological academic transcripts, publication DOIs, and council registration numbers.\n3. Keep attested degrees, HEC equivalence letters, PM&DC/PEC/PNC licenses, and prior university service certificates ready (see our [Official Documents Checklist Guide 2026](/jobs/government-jobs-documents-checklist-pakistan-2026)).\n4. Compare regional private university faculty standards in our [TIMES University Multan (TUM) Faculty Jobs Guide](/jobs/times-university-multan-tum-jobs-2026).",
      "## Frequently Asked Questions (FAQs)",
      "### Can I still apply for the 10 October 2026 UOL advertisement?\nThe specific positions advertised with the **10 October 2026** deadline have closed for initial shortlisting. However, UOL continuously publishes fresh semester and hospital vacancies on [careers.uol.edu.pk](https://careers.uol.edu.pk/).",
      "### Where can faculty and healthcare professionals explore other open jobs in Punjab?\nBrowse active university, healthcare, and corporate listings in [Private Sector Jobs in Pakistan](/category/private-jobs) and public-sector teaching/medical posts in [Government Jobs](/category/government-jobs)."
    ],
    "seoTitle": "University of Lahore (UOL) Jobs 2026 — Faculty & Hospital",
