    "slug": "maju-karachi-jobs-faculty-staff-2026",
    "title": "Mohammad Ali Jinnah University (MAJU) Karachi Jobs 2026 — Faculty & Staff Career Guide (Closed Oct 15)",
    "category": "private-jobs",
    "organization": "Mohammad Ali Jinnah University (MAJU), Karachi",
    "jobType": "Full-Time Academic Faculty & University Administration",
    "location": "Karachi (22-E, Block-6, P.E.C.H.S., Shahrah-e-Faisal)",
    "qualification": "PhD / MS / MPhil (HEC Criteria) for Faculty; MBA / BS / MS for Administrative & Lab Staff",
    "salary": "Market-Competitive University Pay Scale + Research Incentives & Provident Fund",
    "experience": "As per HEC & PEC Faculty Appointment Criteria / 1–5 Years for Staff Roles",
    "positions": "Professors, Associate/Assistant Professors, Lecturers, Lab Engineers & Admin Officers",
    "lastDate": "2026-10-15",
    "noDeadline": false,
    "publishDate": "2026-09-27",
    "officialLink": "https://career.maju.edu.pk/",
    "applyLink": "https://jinnah.edu/careers/",
    "isVerified": true,
    "featured": true,
    "logoInitial": "MJ",
    "featuredImage": "/images/maju-karachi-university-jobs-2026.webp",
    "imageAlt": "Mohammad Ali Jinnah University MAJU Karachi Faculty and Staff Jobs 2026 Career Guide",
    "excerpt": "Mohammad Ali Jinnah University (MAJU) Karachi recruits academic faculty and administrative staff through its official career portal (career.maju.edu.pk). While the October 15, 2026 batch has closed, review verified HEC faculty eligibility, campus details, and official application steps.",
    "content": [
      "## Recruitment Status Update (Verified October 19, 2026)\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Current Status — October 15, 2026 Recruitment Window Closed:**\n> The scheduled faculty and administrative application cycle advertised by **Mohammad Ali Jinnah University (MAJU), Karachi** closed on **October 15, 2026**. Shortlisted candidates from that cycle are contacted directly by the MAJU Human Resources Directorate for subject demonstrations and panel interviews. Prospective applicants can monitor upcoming semester openings and maintain candidate profiles via the official [MAJU Careers Portal](https://career.maju.edu.pk/) and [jinnah.edu/careers](https://jinnah.edu/careers/).",
      "## Institutional Overview & Karachi Campus Location\n\nChartered by the Government of Sindh and recognized by the **Higher Education Commission (HEC)**, the **Pakistan Engineering Council (PEC)**, the **National Computing Education Accreditation Council (NCEAC)**, and the **National Business Education Accreditation Council (NBEAC)**, **Mohammad Ali Jinnah University (MAJU)** is a major private-sector research and teaching university located on **Main Shahrah-e-Faisal (22-E, Block-6, P.E.C.H.S.), Karachi**.\n\nMAJU conducts semester-based recruitment ahead of Fall and Spring academic intakes to appoint permanent full-time faculty members, lab engineers, research associates, and administrative officers across its three core faculties.",
      "## Academic Faculties & Hiring Departments at MAJU Karachi\n\n| FACULTY / DIVISION | ACADEMIC DEPARTMENTS & SPECIALIZATIONS | TYPICAL DESIGNATIONS RECRUITED |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **Faculty of Computing (FoC)** | Computer Science, Software Engineering, Artificial Intelligence, Data Science & Cyber Security | Professor, Associate Professor, Assistant Professor, Lecturer, Lab Engineer / Instructor |\n| **Faculty of Engineering (FoE)** | Electrical & Computer Engineering, Computer Systems Engineering, Power & Electronics | HEC/PEC PhD Faculty, Senior Lecturer, PEC-Registered Lab Engineer |\n| **Faculty of Life Sciences** | Biosciences, Biotechnology, Biochemistry & Bioinformatics | Assistant Professor (PhD), Lecturer (MS/MPhil), Lab Demonstrator |\n| **Faculty of Business Administration & Social Sciences (FBASS)** | Management Sciences (BBA/MBA), Accounting & Finance, Economics, Psychology & English | Professor, Associate/Assistant Professor, Lecturer, Research Associate |\n| **University Administration & Support** | Quality Enhancement Cell (QEC), Examinations, Admissions, ORIC, IT Services, Finance & Student Affairs | Manager / Deputy Manager, Assistant Registrar, IT Network Engineer, Student Counselor |",
      "## HEC-Aligned Eligibility Criteria for Academic & Staff Positions\n\nAppointments at Mohammad Ali Jinnah University follow statutory **Higher Education Commission (HEC)** and **Pakistan Engineering Council (PEC)** appointment criteria:\n\n1. **Professor (BPS-21 Equivalent Corporate Scale):** PhD in the relevant discipline from an HEC-recognized institution with at least **15 years** of university teaching/research experience (or 10 years post-PhD) and **15 HEC-recognized research publications** (including at least 5 within the last 5 years).\n2. **Associate Professor:** PhD in the relevant field with **10 years** teaching/research experience (or 5 years post-PhD) and **10 research publications** in HEC-recognized impact-factor journals.\n3. **Assistant Professor:** PhD in the relevant discipline from an HEC-recognized local or foreign university (no prior teaching experience mandatory for fresh PhDs, though university teaching and research output are preferred).\n4. **Lecturer:** Minimum **18 years of education (MS / MPhil)** in the relevant discipline from an HEC-recognized institution with a minimum **3.00/4.00 CGPA** (First Division) and no third division throughout the academic career.\n5. **Lab Engineer / Lab Instructor:** Minimum **16 years of education (BS / BE)** in Computing, Electrical Engineering, or Biosciences with strong hands-on laboratory instruction skills (valid PEC registration required for Engineering labs).\n6. **Administrative & Management Staff:** Master's or 4-year Bachelor's degree (MBA, BS CS, ACCA/CA-Inter, or M.Com) with 2 to 5 years of relevant higher-education administration experience.",
      "## How to Apply via the Official MAJU Karachi Career Portal\n\nWhen recruitment cycles are active—or when submitting an online profile for upcoming semester vacancies—candidates should use only MAJU's official HR channels:\n\n1. **Visit the Official Portal:** Access the online recruitment system at [career.maju.edu.pk](https://career.maju.edu.pk/) or navigate via [jinnah.edu/careers](https://jinnah.edu/careers/).\n2. **Create an Applicant Profile:** Register with a valid email address and CNIC, entering complete academic credentials (SSC, HSSC, BS, MS/MPhil, PhD), HEC equivalence details (for foreign degrees), and HEC-indexed publication lists.\n3. **Official HR Email Submission:** Where an advertisement specifies direct email submission, send your updated CV and cover letter to **`jobs@jinnah.edu`**, clearly writing the **Position Title and Department** in the subject line.\n4. **Selection & Trial Lecture Process:** Shortlisted academic candidates are invited to the P.E.C.H.S. Karachi campus for a **15–20 minute teaching demonstration (mock lecture)** before the Departmental Selection Committee, followed by a formal panel interview.\n5. **Campus Contact Reference:** Human Resources Department, Mohammad Ali Jinnah University, 22-E, Block-6, P.E.C.H.S., Shahrah-e-Faisal, Karachi (`+92-21-111-87-87-87`).",
      "## Candidate Fraud-Prevention Advisory\n\n> [!WARNING]\n> **No Recruitment Fee Policy:**\n> Mohammad Ali Jinnah University (MAJU) never charges an application fee, dossier evaluation fee, or interview fee. All official communications originate exclusively from `@jinnah.edu` or `@maju.edu.pk` domains."
    ],
