    "organization": "Devsinc Pakistan",
    "jobType": "Full-Time Software Engineering & Quality Assurance (On-Site / Hybrid / Project-Remote)",
    "location": "Lahore & Islamabad Core Hubs (with Project-Specific Hybrid/Remote Options)",
    "qualification": "BS / BE / MS in Computer Science, Software Engineering, IT or Equivalent",
    "salary": "Market-Competitive IT Package + Performance Bonuses, Health Coverage & Provident Fund",
    "experience": "Fresh Graduates (Associate Track) to 2–5+ Years (Senior QA & Full-Stack Tracks)",
    "positions": "QA Automation Engineers, Manual/API Testers, Associate Software Engineers & Full-Stack Developers",
    "lastDate": "2026-10-15",
    "noDeadline": false,
    "publishDate": "2026-09-19",
    "officialLink": "https://www.devsinc.com/careers",
    "applyLink": "https://apply.workable.com/devsinc/",
    "isVerified": true,
    "featured": false,
    "logoInitial": "DI",
    "featuredImage": "/images/devsinc-remote-qa-engineer.webp",
    "imageAlt": "Devsinc Careers Pakistan 2026 QA Automation and Software Engineering Hiring Guide",
    "excerpt": "Explore verified Devsinc Pakistan career tracks in QA Automation, Manual Testing, and Software Engineering across Lahore and Islamabad hubs (with project-specific hybrid/remote options). While the October 15, 2026 QA requisition has closed, check ongoing openings on Devsinc Workable ATS.",
    "content": [
      "## Requisition Status & Rolling ATS Pipeline (Verified October 19, 2026)\n\n> [!NOTE]\n> **Current Status — October 15, 2026 QA Requisition Closed / Rolling Workable ATS Active:**\n> The specific **QA Automation Engineer** requisition tracked on CareerDost closed on **October 15, 2026**. However, **Devsinc Pakistan** maintains a continuous recruitment pipeline across Quality Assurance, Associate Software Engineering, DevOps, AI/ML, and Business Development on its official **Workable Applicant Tracking System (ATS)** at [apply.workable.com/devsinc](https://apply.workable.com/devsinc/) and [devsinc.com/careers](https://www.devsinc.com/careers).",
      "## About Devsinc Pakistan & Work Mode Policy\n\nFounded in 2009, **Devsinc** is one of Pakistan's largest enterprise software development and IT staff-augmentation companies, employing over 2,000 engineers serving North American, European, and Middle Eastern clients.\n\n- **Primary Engineering Delivery Hubs:** **Lahore** (Main Campus, Ghazi Road / DHA) and **Islamabad**.\n- **Work Arrangement Clarification:** While Devsinc occasionally opens **project-specific remote or hybrid roles** for experienced mid-to-senior engineers across Pakistan (including Karachi, Rawalpindi, and Faisalabad), the majority of entry-level **Associate Software Engineer (ASE)** and **Junior QA** cohorts operate **on-site** at the Lahore and Islamabad campuses.",
      "## Core QA Automation & Engineering Competency Matrix\n\nCandidates applying for **Quality Assurance (QA) Automation** or **SDET (Software Development Engineer in Test)** positions at Devsinc are evaluated against the following technical stack:\n\n| COMPETENCY AREA | REQUIRED TOOLS, FRAMEWORKS & PRACTICES |\n| :--- | :--- |\n| **UI & End-to-End Test Automation** | Hands-on framework design using **Selenium WebDriver, Cypress, Playwright, or Appium** (JavaScript/TypeScript, Python, or Java) |\n| **API & Backend Verification** | RESTful and GraphQL API testing using **Postman, Newman, RestAssured, or SoapUI**; validating JSON schemas, status codes, and auth tokens |\n| **CI/CD & DevOps Integration** | Integrating automated regression suites into **GitHub Actions, GitLab CI, Jenkins, or Azure DevOps** pipelines |\n| **Database & Performance Testing** | Writing complex **SQL queries** (PostgreSQL / MySQL) for data integrity checks and conducting load testing via **Apache JMeter or k6** |\n| **Agile / Scrum Defect Lifecycle** | Writing test plans, traceability matrices, and reproducible bug reports in **Jira, TestRail, or Zephyr** within 2-week Scrum sprints |",
      "## Devsinc 4-Stage Technical Recruitment Process\n\nApplications submitted through Devsinc's official Workable portal undergo a standardized four-stage assessment:\n\n1. **Stage 1 — ATS Resume Screening & HR Discovery Call (15–20 mins):** Talent Acquisition specialists review your GitHub portfolio, degree background, and project experience, followed by a brief phone screening covering communication skills, notice period, and location preference.\n2. **Stage 2 — Online Coding / QA Assessment:** Candidates complete an online technical test or practical automation assignment evaluating data structures, object-oriented programming (OOP), SQL joins, test-case design, and script debugging.\n3. **Stage 3 — Deep-Dive Technical Panel Interview (45–60 mins):** Senior QA Architects or Engineering Leads assess framework architecture (Page Object Model), API mocking, asynchronous wait handling, CI/CD troubleshooting, and live problem-solving.\n4. **Stage 4 — Cultural Fit & Compensation Offer:** Final discussion with Engineering Management and People Operations covering career growth tracks, medical insurance, provident fund, and bi-annual performance appraisals.",
      "## How to Apply Safely via Devsinc's Official Workable Portal\n\n1. **Browse Live Requisitions:** Visit [devsinc.com/careers](https://www.devsinc.com/careers) or go directly to Devsinc's verified job board at [apply.workable.com/devsinc](https://apply.workable.com/devsinc/).\n2. **Filter by Department & Location:** Filter open roles by **Engineering**, **Quality Assurance**, **AI/Data**, or **Business Development**, and check whether the listing is tagged **On-site (Lahore/Islamabad)**, **Hybrid**, or **Remote**.\n3. **Submit Your Resume & GitHub Profile:** Upload a clean PDF resume highlighting measurable engineering outcomes, test automation repositories, and live project links.\n4. **Zero-Fee Safety Reminder:** Devsinc never charges candidates for job applications, coding assessments, or onboarding equipment."
    ],
